      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_1",
          "text": "The chapter describes a high priest as someone appointed by God to represent people before God, offering gifts and sacrifices for sins. This frames Jesus\u2019 priesthood not as self-promotion: he is named a priest \u201cafter the order of Melchizedek,\u201d while the chapter also presents him as God\u2019s Son.",
