      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_2",
          "text": "Verses 5\u201310 use words drawn from the Psalms to speak of Jesus\u2019 sonship and priesthood. More broadly, New Testament writers quote and echo psalms when discussing Jesus\u2019 suffering, resurrection, enthronement, priesthood, mission, worship, creation, and the life of believing communities. The extent and significance of particular echoes remains debated.",
